<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian Feb trade deficit widens to $95.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenian Feb trade deficit widens to $95.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in million of dollars)</p>
<p>				 Feb	   Jan	     Feb 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -95.8	 -50.1	    -88.2</p>
<p>    Exports		 635.9	 615.4	    676.3</p>
<p>    Imports		 731.7	 665.5	    764.5</p>
<p>(NOTE: all figures rounded) -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
